# Keep the build context lean and - critically - keep secrets and local
# state out of the image. All configuration is injected at run time via
# `docker run --env-file`; no .env file is ever copied in.

# Secrets / local environment (never bake into an image)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dependencies and build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo

# VCS and CI
.git
.github

# Test/report artifacts
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log

# Editor / OS cruft
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
